{"items": [{"shortCode": "DehjhGgRtsV", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DehjhGgRtsV/", "caption": "My customers just told me what my brand actually is\u2026 so I rebuilt the whole thing in one day.\n\nI took the entire day (and night) to re-do the creative strategy research, make new ads, and relaunch the site on @lovable.dev (and finally moved to Shopify \ud83d\ude42).\n\nThe plan:\n- Spend $1000\n- Lower CPMs & CPA\n- More email signups, ATCs, purchases\n\nIf this works, ONE MORE TEST and then I'm off to China to make the product.\n\nReal question: would you buy sunglasses marketed for migraines, or does that sound weird? Be honest \ud83d\udc47\n\n#LovablePartner", "timestamp": "2026-10-15T18:03:02.000Z", "videoDuration": 125.833336, "videoPlayCount": 10868, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 376, "commentsCount": 33, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/851829235_18635373262020207_3468291030250504265_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ig_cache_key=NDAwODY0MTM0OTY5MTAzODQ4NTE4NjM1MzczMjU5MDIwMjA3.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=IWq_DiyydMEQ7kNvwFbRlxK&_nc_oc=AdphEqGmQOaFfiL5MGQis_ba8ud7NdMqTHIvxFWvrP2o2y3xolO0A2ZxlsbSWI4kbYrESqtA4Z8uyQ7a4CvFIGs4&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=2m3koO3by7KvjR3z6Thw7Q&_nc_ss=7a20f&oh=00_AQM8sOpk1zHq5_8ugr615OaOPV5OlWb3oQkcIcrnvTTTyQ&oe=6AE52382", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQMo9EZ58-r4aT3n8U0UiNulAvV2cPtYID8m-Hd-NWZ0ScyCncDWAUjfXFSxpRrIJc7QSRrhlb71XKPPfQaT_xg1lgqMAgDVbw_m5jY.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=JQIophdKNRQQ7kNvwGIKaaJ&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTQ2OTcyNzY1MTY3NDQ4MywiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjEwLCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDA5OSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6MTI1LCJ1cmx