\u2019s Jax always makes checking in on the finances WAY EASIER. \n\nIf only Jax could handle my client comms\u2026 :) #xeropartner #ad", "timestamp": "2026-10-22T16:03:25.000Z", "videoDuration": 67.692696, "videoPlayCount": 9851, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 305, "commentsCount": 16, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-fco2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/863019880_18637929760020207_2490278410840048963_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=101&ig_cache_key=NDAxMzY1MjQxOTE2NTkwMjI4MTE4NjM3OTI5NzU3MDIwMjA3.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=ewTcRHOedE8Q7kNvwHI2lSb&_nc_oc=Ado3Eko8zX-bnHCMDkwWpavYwV6TLR2j2XapWrv_6xczONQQjJq2ug8F8fi12FYtnwM&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-fco2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=TH9q_r60fbkzd6SjxDBhPQ&_nc_ss=7a20f&oh=00_AQOASH8A5NV4O_GFBc4bTRBnITVSGCFzSUvxyg8y6kJcxg&oe=6AE52AB6", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-fco2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQPxzY1zjSP__igPq8dTUKk_kfjkSP6hi5XjoVltoslYuqnPnAS1_kGjX_C5Vl0-ABcyG0nnj5z0T8UyCgc0oi_1MWrjVkylcm1SiR4.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-fco2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=VrcalrFDVGkQ7kNvwEJi_Ff&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTgyNjcwNDI0ODU3NjcxMywiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjMsInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEwMDk5LCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjo2NywidXJsZ2VuX3NvdXJjZSI6Ind3dyJ9&ccb=17-1&vs=4456e7d4fccf66a9&_nc_-BhUCKAJDMywXQFDsSbpeNT8YEmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MREAdf4HZeadAQA&_nc_gid=TH9q_r60fbkzd6SjxDBhPQ&_nc_zt=28&_nc_ss=70980&oh=00_AQMELK0xKiOu2FGrDIt8hHL3mvNWxUq1l9epc-mct12n2A&oe=6AE1270A", "transcript": null, "ownerUsername": "daradenney", "ownerFullName": "Dara Denney | Performance Marketing Expert"}, {"shortCode": "Deb_IaLxvfW", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Deb_IaLxvfW/", "caption": "How AI should be used in marketing:\n\nMore content < Better experience\n\nHuge thanks to the @braze team for having 